# Response headers for the static assets (the web app, including the /device approval page), applied
# by Workers Static Assets in production and by `wrangler dev`. The Worker's own /api responses set
# theirs in server/src/http.ts. No page of the app is ever meant to be framed: that keeps another site,
# or a sibling subdomain, from overlaying the device approval page and tricking a click on Approve.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: same-origin
